        "description": "<p>You can take one light magic/tech Kit — Hexshot (ranged caster), Spellblade (melee-adjacent), or Sanctified — whose magic damage rider reskins as elemental essence. A pure artillery Elementalist picks <strong>No Kit (Pure Caster)</strong>, which grants nothing, and lets their signature focus do the work of a weapon. (<em>Quick Build:</em> No Kit.)</p>",
        "chooseN": 1,
        "sort": 3000,
