        "description": "<p>Choose your element cluster: <strong>Pyromancer</strong> (fire, the blaster), <strong>Stormcaller</strong> (air and water, the battlefield mover), or <strong>Geomancer</strong> (earth and void, the fortress). Each grants a skill, a signature summon, and a signature focus. (<em>Quick Build:</em> Pyromancer.)</p><p><strong>Cyborgs can’t be Elementalists</strong> (Arcane Severance).</p>",
        "chooseN": 1,
